{"id":"05e9e72ec4c6672f","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-noble-forcing.md","title":"Namba Forcing under CH","display":"thm-noble-forcing — Namba Forcing under CH","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-noble-forcing","aliases":["58-thm-noble-forcing"],"display":"thm-noble-forcing — Namba Forcing under CH","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-noble-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-noble-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-noble-forcing — Namba Forcing under CH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_2^V\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_2^V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the tree of finite ordinal sequences.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_N,\\leq_N\\in V\">\\(P_N,\\leq_N\\in V\\)</span> are the Namba condition set and its order.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the continuum hypothesis in the ground model.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)=\\{\\xi&lt;\\kappa:t^\\frown\\langle\\xi\\rangle\\in T\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)=\\{\\xi&lt;\\kappa:t^\\frown\\langle\\xi\\rangle\\in T\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}_T(t)\\leftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Split}_T(t)\\leftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> are explicitly defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}namba\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S(T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(t)\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;\n(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists u\\in T\\;\n(t\\subseteq u\\land\\operatorname{Split}_T(u))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=1\n\\lor|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\kappa\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}namba\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S(T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(t)\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;\n(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists u\\in T\\;\n(t\\subseteq u\\land\\operatorname{Split}_T(u))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=1\n\\lor|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\kappa\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}namba\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\nP=\\{T\\in V:\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S(T,\\kappa)\\}\n\\land\\forall T,T&#39;\\in P\\;(T\\leq_PT&#39;\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq T&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}namba\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\nP=\\{T\\in V:\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S(T,\\kappa)\\}\n\\land\\forall T,T&#39;\\in P\\;(T\\leq_PT&#39;\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq T&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}noble\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}\n\\land\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S\n(P_N,\\leq_N,\\omega_2^V)\n\\to\n\\langle P_N,\\leq_N\\rangle\\Vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{cf}(\\check\\omega_2^V)=\\omega\n\\land\\check\\omega_1^V=\\omega_1\n\\land\\mathbb R=\\check{\\mathbb R}^{\\,V}\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}noble\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}\n\\land\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S\n(P_N,\\leq_N,\\omega_2^V)\n\\to\n\\langle P_N,\\leq_N\\rangle\\Vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{cf}(\\check\\omega_2^V)=\\omega\n\\land\\check\\omega_1^V=\\omega_1\n\\land\\mathbb R=\\check{\\mathbb R}^{\\,V}\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intended forcing is Namba forcing; “Noble” is retained only in the filename.  Its tree carrier and reverse-inclusion order are now part of the formal antecedent.</li>\n<li>Under CH it changes the cofinality of the ground-model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_2\">\\(\\omega_2\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, preserves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>, and adds no reals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa=\\omega_2^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"P_N,\\leq_N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)=\\{\\xi<\\kappa:t^\\frown\\langle\\xi\\rangle\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Split}_T(t)\\leftrightarrow|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}namba\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S(T,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nT\\subseteq\\kappa^{<\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(t)\\;\n(t\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists s\\in T\\;\\forall t\\in T\\;\n(t\\subseteq s\\lor s\\subseteq t)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists u\\in T\\;\n(t\\subseteq u\\land\\operatorname{Split}_T(u))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=1\n\\lor|\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)|=\\kappa\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}namba\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\nP=\\{T\\in V:\\mathrm{NambaTree}_S(T,\\kappa)\\}\n\\land\\forall T,T'\\in P\\;(T\\leq_PT'\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq T').","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}noble\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CH}\n\\land\\mathrm{NambaForcing}_S\n(P_N,\\leq_N,\\omega_2^V)\n\\to\n\\langle P_N,\\leq_N\\rangle\\Vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{cf}(\\check\\omega_2^V)=\\omega\n\\land\\check\\omega_1^V=\\omega_1\n\\land\\mathbb R=\\check{\\mathbb R}^{\\,V}\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":2198,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-thm-noble-forcing.md|58-thm-noble-forcing]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["d06ac5a66d69d291","315ad00b8744fdfc","36d7463d215be751"]}